record_grade=formal (Indonesia halal core, 2026-09-15).

【关键节点】2026-10-18 全面强制、官方不再延期。过渡期截止日为 2026-10-17（PP 42/2024 Pasal 160 ayat (2)/(3)、Pasal 161）；自次日 2026-10-18 起适用（BPJPH 公告 “mulai berlaku pada 18 Oktober 2026”）。BPJPH 已公开推进 Wajib Halal Oktober 2026，未见新的 UU/PP 延期原文。

UU 33/2014 (LN 2014/295, TLN 5604) is the parent statute for Jaminan Produk Halal:
(1) Pasal 4 mandatory Sertifikat Halal for products entering/circulating/traded in Indonesia;
(2) BPJPH–LPH–MUI institutional split (Pasal 5–10);
(3) non-halal marking for haram-origin products (Pasal 26);
(4) criminal sanction Pasal 56 (up to 5 years / Rp2 miliar);
(5) Pasal 67 five-year phased start from promulgation (2019-10-17), later detailed by PP 42/2024 to the 2026-10-18 mandate.
Official Bahasa Indonesia PDF: https://cmsbl.halal.go.id/uploads/2014_UU_Nomor_33_Tahun_2014_Jaminan_Produk_Halal_2209235c2a.pdf. BPJPH index: https://bpjph.halal.go.id/detail/perbadan. Local MD5 babdc688d0067695b145e23e2a5b2ff6.
